		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Shapeshifting, trickster faerie that appears as a humanoid badger. Merry pranksters that love taverns and inns.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 staff +1 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Jug</strong>. Carries a clay jug filled with fey wine. 3/day, drinking has effect chosen by tanuki: cure wounds, confusion, gaseous form, or restoration. Jug crumbles to dust if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapeshift</strong>. In place of attacks, transform into a humanoid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
